        "grammar.there_is"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "किसी जगह कुछ होने की बात: एक चीज़ के लिए ‘There is’, एक से ज़्यादा के लिए ‘There are’।",
        "hinglish": "Kisi jagah kuch hone ki baat: ek cheez ke liye ‘There is’, ek se zyaada ke liye ‘There are’.",
        "en": "To say something is somewhere: ‘There is’ for one thing, ‘There are’ for more than one."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U09.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.there_is"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "मेज़ पर एक किताब है = There is a book on the table. पेड़ पर दो चिड़िया हैं = There are two birds on the tree.",
        "hinglish": "Mez par ek kitaab hai = There is a book on the table. Ped par do chidiya hain = There are two birds on the tree.",
        "en": "There is a book on the table. There are two birds on the tree."
      }
    },
